messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 777475107 and 557735475? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 777475107 and 557735475, we can follow these steps:.\n\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, making sure that the ones, tens, hundreds, thousands, and so on, are in the same columns.\n2. Add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place).\n3. If the sum of the digits in any column is 10 or more, carry over the extra digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue adding the digits in each column, including any carried-over digits, until you reach the leftmost column (the billions place).\n\nLet's perform the addition:.\n\n```.\n  777475107.\n+  557735475.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n7 + 5 = 12 (write down 2 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column (tens place):.\n\n1 + 4 + 7 = 12 (write down 2 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column (hundreds place):.\n\n2 + 3 + 5 = 10 (write down 0 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column (thousands place):.\n\n0 + 5 + 4 = 9 (no carry-over needed).\n\nNext column (ten-thousands place):.\n\n1 + 7 + 3 = 11 (write down 1 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column (hundred-thousands place):.\n\n1 + 7 + 5 = 13 (write down 3 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column (millions place):.\n\n1 + 7 + 7 = 15 (write down 5 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column (ten-millions place):.\n\n1 + 5 + 5 = 11 (write down 1 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column (hundred-millions place):.\n\n1 + 7 + 5 = 13 (write down 3 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column (billion place):.\n\n1 + 7 + 5 = 13 (write down 3 and carry over 1).\n\nFinally, we have the sum:.\n\n```.\n  777475107.\n+  557735475.\n-----------.\n 1335210582.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 777475107 and 557735475 is 1335210582.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
